description_text:
Completely finished Realistic Military Aircrafts Pack for creating both gaming and non-commercial projects. This package of well-optimized models can add more variety, visual interest and spectacularity to your projects.
The pack includes the following aircrafts (3 helicopters, 5 planes & 3 rockets / without animation):

  - Bell AH-1 Cobra (3 model varieties and 8 color classes);

  - Fighter Aircraft;

  - H70 Air-to-Ground Rocket (Hydra) (3 model varieties);

  - Maize Plane;

  - Messerschmitt Bf 109;

  - Seaplane;

  - SuperMarine Spitfire.

Technical details:

  - 12 unique models with prefabs;

  - Ready-for-animation models;

  - 35 PBR textures;

  - Texture Size: 1024x1024, 2048 x 2048 (Albedo, Normal, Metallic, Specular);

  - Poly count: 1,400-5,100.

  - Demo-scene is included.

Realistic Military Aircrafts Pack is a collection of attack planes and helicopters perfect for developers creating educational projects and just for enthusiasts who are fond of war&shooting games and defenders.

Interior scene of a library lobby hall of an aerospace university. 
Polygons: 439,472Vertices: 448,796
Features:

  - Scene objects are organized by groups;

  - Real-world scale objects, mm;

  - Clean mesh (quads mostly);

  - Model is fully textured with all materials applied;

  - All map paths were stripped;

  - Optimized textures (67 high-resolution maps in total);

  - Materials and renderer: V-Ray 3.6;

  - Available formats: 2017MAX, 2019FBX(2014/2015 Compitable), 2020OBJ.
